{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-29","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与平方与比例","englishTitle":"To find two rational straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with the greater.","book":10,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","contentId":"euclid-10-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79a6cd4f43a59e3b815bb4f87ee759e2da7943983fadeb279313bd5e459c3b0e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-29.statement","euclid-10-29.construction.1","euclid-10-29.construction.2","euclid-10-29.proof.1","euclid-10-29.proof.2","euclid-10-29.proof.3","euclid-10-29.proof.4","euclid-10-29.proof.5","euclid-10-29.proof.6","euclid-10-29.proof.7","euclid-10-29.proof.8","euclid-10-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04c2251dddf86ac3eefbd5994fbb6a1413dbe6d2bfa16d6f9046df79e543c6f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two rational straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"发现两枚有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度, 数量大于正方形, 数量大于正方形, 数量大于正方形, 数量大于正方形, 直线长度可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"626c98ef3a0d474c02d5d7b7de35e601c9be777f19c44f3d0e14b89d36f75781","citations":["euclid-10-28","euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be set out any rational straight line AB, and two square numbers CD, DE such that their difference CE is not square; [[Lemma 1](/principles/euclid-10-28)] let there be described on AB the semicircle AFB, and let it be contrived that, as DC is to CE, so is the square on BA to the square on AF. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨列出任何有理线段 AB和2 平方数 CD,DE, 其差额CE不是正方形;请在AB说明AFB半圆圈,并假设DC-CE的比等于BA和正方形的比 [[引理 1](/principles/euclid-10-28)] [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a575f6a72a5db4e632b6ce3b1e74d55400aea42b278a4fcfccca167b39e4448","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let FB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让FB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5d1df2291a940bbd2f09723e3551f20f8e8fc9bb8f6958c9b07a4f6a246cc43","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, as the square on BA is to the square on AF, so is DC to CE, therefore the square on BA has to the square on AF the ratio which the number DC has to the number CE; therefore the square on BA is commensurable with the square on AF. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BA比正方形等于DC比CE,BA比正方形,AF比正方形,AF比正方形比AF,DC比CE,DC比CE,BA比正方形,BA比可公度,可公度比可公度,AF比AF。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8f82e115c4df3b86455bd108fe7cd5139fb79ec71db58e1d32e83f4a823c0c4","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AB is rational; [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)] therefore the square on AF is also rational; [id.] therefore AF is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB的正方形是有理,AF的正方形也是有理,[id.]因此AF也是有理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"720017d1ba8f78c618eecd8ea0ae3ef1c3428b9d9694e501b8b72879def563c6","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DC has not to CE the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on BA to the square on AF the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore AB is incommensurable in length with AF. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DC的比例没有达到CE的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,BA的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,AF的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例。（相关点与线段：AB）；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce60acca9d3578a95076719a473a7c95ba617cdf70b851bccf64167a0912c84b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BA, AF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA,AF是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b76c12ca3cf38f22d08f9d5c9a6de80098c2bcf8209cc5eb7aab253c57a7367","citations":["euclid-5-19","euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as DC is to CE, so is the square on BA to the square on AF, therefore, convertendo, as CD is to DE, so is the square on AB to the square on BF. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19), [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31), [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC比CE等于BA比正方形,AF,CD比DE,AB比正方形,BF比正方形 [ [V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19) [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"491e6a792aad480bece7c9986c48c0d7de4435efba3ee42904c68c72a67c9c54","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD has to DE the ratio which a square number has to a square number: therefore also the square on AB has to the square on BF the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore AB is commensurable in length with BF. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CD的比例为DE,而平方数的比例为平方数,而AB的比例为平方数,而AB的比例为正方形,而BF的比例为平方数,DE的比例为平方数,AB的比例为长度可公度,BF的比例为长度可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98fbc8bb277fedb17b15eaf8440d6c377728fbb9a60482c2558a6c26b50f08ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on AB is equal to the squares on AF, FB; therefore the square on AB is greater than the square on AF by the square on BF commensurable with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB的正方形等于AF的正方形,FB的正方形,AB的正方形比AF的正方形多,BF的可公度和AB的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95c3398bf41b7dd8a9955ef01df64feb8d9419c39725f2cf8b1cd979b1c67d52","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there have been found two rational straight lines BA, AF commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater AB is greater than the square on the less AF by the square on BF commensurable in length with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，已经找到两条仅在平方上可公度的有理线段 BA、AF；较长线段 AB 的平方比 AF 的平方大，差额等于 BF 的平方，并且 BF 与 AB 在长度上可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-29.source","contentId":"euclid-10-29","revisionId":"euclid-10-29@raw-79a6cd4f43a59e3b","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91b5447cd26322a35a1f8c0ad0fa4808a275331fcae3d562591e73a05ef8b936","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-29:euclid-10-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-29.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29/","sourceLabel":"Lemma 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-29:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-29.construction.1","euclid-10-29.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.29/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-29:euclid-10-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-29.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-4","type